## Output

Reply with one JSON object and nothing else:

{"route": "analyze_video", "agents": ["asr", "video"], "reason": "<one line>"}

- `analyze_video`: a video was referenced for the first time and needs analysis.
- `ask_video`: a question about the video on screen; `agents` lists only the branches that must still produce something.
- `chat`: a text-only task; you answer it yourself, using the video on screen only when it helps.
- `text_file`: a text file was referenced; you read it and answer.

